 "notes": "The lattice is the independently reported ambient characterization, V=86.51(1) A^3. The executable EOS instead uses the distinct 86.71(2) A^3 in situ zero-pressure row that Xu et al. fixed as V0; the source discrepancy is retained explicitly. The approximate formula is a transparent stoichiometric conversion of the reported oxide weights plus water-by-deficit estimate, not a direct site-occupancy or hydrogen analysis. This material is compositionally distinct from the Mg-rich phase_d and Fe-bearing al-phase-D records already present.",
